<title>THAILAND: Star Block reports large first qtr loss.</title>
<headline>Star Block reports large first qtr loss.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1997			   1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht) loss     36.90	 vs  profit    1.58</p>
<p>    Net	  loss  2,227.72	 vs  profit   89.06</p>
<p>Notes: Results are unaudited. Company's full name is Star Block Plc, a construction firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
